    "Which bits of this instruction word mean what, and does it decode back to the same word?",
    "How fast is each build or kernel against its baseline, and did the last run move?",
    "What is running behind this chat right now: which panes, scripts and actors?",
    "Which project checks pass now, and which one should I open first?",
    "What did the loops learn that I should not repeat?",
    "Which T27F surface answers my intent, and what is its status?",
    "Which agent is doing what right now, and which issue did the Queen assign to whom?",
    "Which bee is on which issue right now?",
    "Which open issue does the Queen pick next, and which label decided it?",
    "Which lab jobs are queued, running or done, and of what kind?",
    "Which card sits in which column, and what is blocked?",
    "What did the night loop just do, line by line, and where did it fail?",
    "Which agent holds which spec, and where does the work cluster?",
    "Which of the 27 domains is moving, which is quiet, which is blocked?",
    "How much of a converted file is proven, function by function?",
    "Which pull request may merge now, and which check blocks the others?",
    "What is the Queen doing now, and what did she improve today?",
    "What ships next, and what does it wait on?",
    "What is in this spec, and which function calls which?",
    "Is the training run getting cheaper, and by how much, measured?",
    "Which course and lesson am I on, and which widget does it open?",
    "Which verdict does this spec carry, and which rule gave it?",
    "Which stage is each widget at: spec, logic, plan, page, data or card?",
    "Which provider is usable now, and when does the next one recover?",
    "Where does the test-network credit come from?",
    "Which chapter of the system documentation answers my question?",
    "Which secret-gate layer would stop this change, and on which rule?",
];

